    This level isn't too hard.  Just remember you have to use the 
transporter, and stay away from the first two places where monsters are 
created.  The only tricky part is near the end.  If you want to grab the 
third piece of jewelry, make sure no monster is coming towards you.  
Also make sure you haven't heard any noises just before you pick up the 
third piece of jewelry.  The only specific strategic point is that if 
you go immediately up and right you will be in a sticky position.  Shoot 
the first snake that comes out before going up.

